<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Will cast reel to full or near full power then do near perfect stop and go reel in .
If fish caught it will keep for money then repeat no fish then just repeat. 

Remove SPACEBAR from the in-game hotkeys as reel in. Just remove it while you want to run this script and it runs flawlessly. Good for farming trout in alberta, using a 42g #4/0 yellow medium spoon. Cast to the left of dock</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveTo 1061 811
LeftDown 1
Delay 2000 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 99 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fishing Planet</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>